# Captured AndroidX Preferences DataStore string values from predecessor 1.1.2-debug, commit 701154806646e4d357885166360fd6a3c2a30b05.
# Values came from production models and stores. Test-created IDs and references are retained; account, device path, and signing identity are excluded.
# The three Custom films intentionally omit polarity and color, as in the predecessor schema.

